        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "83971609-cd06-5cb8-8075-0fb0df68599e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films: Flipper (1996), Flipper (1963), Casper, The Lord of the Rings film trilogy\n- Television: Flipper TV series, Home Improvement\n- People: Paul Hogan, Elijah Wood, Jessica Wesson, Peter Jackson, Zachery Ty Bryan\n- Roles: Frodo Baggins, Jennifer Sudarsky, Brad\n\nFacts:\n- The 1963 film Flipper inspired a television series titled Flipper that ran from 1964 to 1967.\n- Flipper is a 1996 adventure film remake of the 1963 film Flipper.\n- The 1996 film Flipper stars Paul Hogan and Elijah Wood.\n- Elijah Wood is best known for playing Frodo Baggins in Peter Jackson's The Lord of the Rings film trilogy from 2001 to 2003.\n- Jessica Wesson is best known for her recurring role as Jennifer Sudarsky, Brad's first girlfriend, on the sitcom Home Improvement.\n- Brad on Home Improvement was played by Zachery Ty Bryan.\n- Jessica Wesson also had supporting roles in the Universal films Casper and Flipper in the 1990s.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
